``````

Test one of them `moon test a.mbt.md`, and test the other at the same time. The other will be blocked due to file lock

Create a new project

Write a simple test

```moonbit
///|
test "always" {
  let mut i = 0
  while true {
    i += 1
  }
  println(i)
}
```

Write a simple script

```js
const { spawn } = require("node:child_process");

const controller = new AbortController();
const timeoutId = setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), 5000);

const child = spawn("moon", ["test"], {
  stdio: "inherit",
  signal: controller.signal,
});

child.on("error", (err) => {
  clearTimeout(timeoutId);
  console.error(err);
  process.exit(1);
});

child.on("exit", (code, signal) => {
  clearTimeout(timeoutId);
  process.exit(code ?? 1);
});
```

Execute it. The `moonrun` will continue to exist.

